UI Components / Field Description / Requirements
No.	Component / Field	Type	Description	Requirements / Notes
1	Modal Title	Label	Display: Create Material / Update Material	Dynamic based on mode
2	Close Button (X)	Icon Button	Close modal	Always visible
3	Material Code	Textbox	Unique identifier of material	Required, unique, read-only in update mode
4	Material Name	Textbox	Name of material	Required
