Duplicate Material Code is not allowed.
Clicking Save shall trigger create/update logic.
Clicking Cancel or X shall close modal without saving.
After successful save:
Modal closes
Material List Screen is refreshed
This modal is reused for both create and update → 1 UI – multiple UC
