UC-MAT-08_Create Material

ID and Name
UC-MAT-08 – Create Material

Primary Actor:
Administrator

Secondary Actor:
None

Description:
As an administrator, I want to create a new material so that it can be used in BOM and production.

Preconditions:

Actor is on Material List Screen
Actor has create permission

