Alternative Flows:

A1. Actor cancels creation

The actor clicks Cancel or X.
The system closes modal.

Exception:

E1. Missing required fields

In step 5, required fields are empty.
The system highlights fields and displays with "Please fill in all required fields."

E2. Duplicate material code

In step 5, system detects duplicate code.
The system displays with "Material code already exists."

E3. Invalid format input

The system detects invalid data format.
The system displays with "Invalid input data."

Business Rule:

BR-01: Material Code must be unique
BR-02: Required fields must be filled
BR-03: Default status = Active when creating
